{
  "name": "InOut AI - 91 Retry Queue",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "contract-note",
      "name": "Input Output Contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Retry Queue\n\nLoads retry record, enforces retry limits, calculates exponential backoff, executes the original idempotent action, marks success, increments retry count, or escalates permanent failure.\n\nInput: Retry record id or safe retry payload with component, operation, idempotency key, attempt count, and correlation id.\nOutput: { success: true, completed: boolean, retryScheduled: boolean, escalated: boolean }\n\nShared Input Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"correlationId\": \"\",\n  \"messageId\": \"\",\n  \"conversationId\": \"\",\n  \"customerId\": \"\",\n  \"customerPhone\": \"\",\n  \"detectedLanguage\": \"\",\n  \"intent\": \"\",\n  \"payload\": {}\n}\n```\n\nShared Output Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"data\": {},\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"correlationId\": \"\",\n    \"workflow\": \"\",\n    \"durationMs\": 0\n  }\n}\n```\n\nRequired fields:\n- correlationId\n- workflowExecutionId\n- idempotencyKey when writing\n\nRules:\n- Retry only idempotent actions with an idempotency key.\n- Use exponential backoff and cap maximum attempts.\n- Move exhausted or permanent failures to dead-letter queue.\n- Never retry authorization, validation, or unsafe payment/POS writes blindly."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workflow-input",
      "name": "Workflow Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "load-retry-record",
      "name": "Load Retry Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -1040,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{($node[\"Workflow Config\"].json[\"SERVICE_API_BASE_URL\"] || 'MISSING_SERVICE_API_BASE_URL').replace(/\\/$/, '').replace(/\\/api\\/v1$/i, '') + '/api/v1/retry-records/' + encodeURIComponent($json.retryRecordId || $json.retry_record_id || $json.job_id || 'inline')}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{'Bearer ' + ($node[\"Workflow Config\"].json[\"N8N_API_KEY\"] || '')}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Correlation-Id",
              "value": "={{$json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{($json.idempotencyKey || $json.idempotency_key || $json.wamid || $json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id || $execution.id)}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": false,
        "contentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{$json}}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "retry-limit-reached",
      "name": "Retry Limit Reached?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -780,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "limit-reached",
              "leftValue": "={{Number($json.body?.data?.attempt || $(\"Workflow Input\").first().json.attempt || 0) >= Number($json.body?.data?.maxAttempts || $(\"Workflow Input\").first().json.maxAttempts || $node[\"Workflow Config\"].json[\"N8N_RETRY_MAX_ATTEMPTS\"] || 5)}}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "calculate-backoff",
      "name": "Calculate Backoff",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input = $('Workflow Input').first().json;\nconst record = $('Load Retry Record').first().json.body?.data || input;\nconst attempt = Number(record.attempt || input.attempt || 0);\nconst baseMs = Number($node[\"Workflow Config\"].json[\"N8N_RETRY_BASE_MS\"] || 60000);\nconst maxMs = Number($node[\"Workflow Config\"].json[\"N8N_RETRY_MAX_BACKOFF_MS\"] || 900000);\nconst delayMs = Math.min(maxMs, baseMs * Math.pow(2, attempt));\nreturn [{ json: { ...record, retryRecordId: record.retryRecordId || record.job_id || input.retryRecordId || input.job_id || '', attempt, delayMs, nextAttempt: attempt + 1, idempotencyKey: record.idempotencyKey || record.idempotency_key || input.idempotencyKey || input.idempotency_key, correlationId: record.correlationId || record.correlation_id || input.correlationId || input.correlation_id || 'corr_' + Date.now() } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wait",
      "name": "Wait",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resume": "timeInterval",
        "amount": "={{Math.max(1, Math.ceil($json.delayMs / 1000))}}",
        "unit": "seconds"
      }
    },
